   "en": "The legend of Geese Howard, the lone genius of Southtown, begins.\n\nFrom the Sicilian Mafia, Geese Howard secretly feuded with Southtown's Mr. BIG and gradually worked his way up the \"organization.\"\nHe absorbed various martial arts and kingcrafts and tried to bring down the originator Krauser, but Terry Bogart beat him to the punch.\nIn an attempt to gain even more power, Geese began searching for the \"Book of Secrets\"..."
